# Keeps this repository usable as a Docker build context, which it now is: omiai-platform builds JavAI
# from source in a named additional build context (`javai-src`) while it depends on a -SNAPSHOT that lives
# only in a local Maven repository. Without this, `docker/data` alone sends 562 MB of local container state
# into the build for a build that wants source and poms.
#
# Mirrors xtrafe-swtch's own .dockerignore, which exists for exactly the same reason, plus the two entries
# specific to this repository.
**/target/
.git/
*.iml

# Local Postgres/Neo4j/Mongo/Ollama state written by docker/docker-compose.yml -- by far the largest thing
# here, and of no use to any build.
docker/data/

.idea/
